To benchmark on Centaurus
1. Pull Git repository
2. run "make" in the "mergesort_task" directory to compile the code
3. run the batch script to execute the code through slurm. Use the following rules:

    Use the following arguments to run on command line:
    sbatch batch_script.sh <n> <nbthreads> 

4. The execution time will be listed at the bottom of the .out file that is generated after execution

Small: N=1,000,000
1 Threads, Execution Time: 0.00804653s
2 Threads, Execution Time: 0.00490085s
4 Threads, Execution Time: 0.00382368s
8 Threads, Execution Time: 0.00338632s
16 Threads, Execution Time: 0.0028636s
32 Threads, Execution Time: 0.0029952s

Medium: N=100,000,000
1 Threads, Execution Time: 12.3806s
2 Threads, Execution Time: 6.56592s
4 Threads, Execution Time: 5.41877s
8 Threads, Execution Time: 3.6304s
16 Threads, Execution Time: 2.30239s
32 Threads, Execution Time: 1.71247s

Large, N=10,000,000,000
